GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 521(7) the warrant may be executed anywhere in Canada` MEANS
    IF `the warrant was issued under subsection (5) or (6)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A warrant issued under subsection (5) or (6) may be executed anywhere in Canada"

